{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are aware some players are having issues <u>dowloading and playing the demo</u>, and are working on a fix. Sorry for the inconvenience!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have had the same job for 30 years: push a button every eight hours of the world will end.\u00a0Today, you got an email asking you to list your five biggest accomplishments for the week, or risk being fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>UGO</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835250/extras/95faffd564bd1bad6024f7a2000f3229.avif?t=1762991717\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Biggest Accomplishments is a short visual novel in which you explore what happens when someone tries to improve government efficiency without having any idea what risks that entails. Watch the story unfold from different points of view and explore different options to learn more about the secrets hidden at UGO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our prologue is available RIGHT NOW for free! Play our demo and let us know what you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835250/extras/e531749b547f874c0d1650728e8efdfa.avif?t=1762991717\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are working on completing the game right now! The full game will have five chapters and several options to explore. We have a first draft, and are working on making the game pretty. Our launch is scheduled for Q1 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835250/extras/6e55289842ee246f94b0afbd9fda3985.avif?t=1762991717\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our current prologue uses cc0 music, but we are working on a completely original soundtrack, as well as new sound design for the game. We are not currently considering full voiceover, but we might budget for it in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Translations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are translating the name to Spanish and Catalan. Let us know if you want us to consider additional languages!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835250?t=1762991717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835250/bf399e4baffad722ddb4b32c8be835372bcce49b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762991717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835250/94fef5765488d992595c2a1e50830b4bdcf8feef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762991717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835250/94fef5765488d992595c2a1e50830b4bdcf8feef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762991717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game deals with politic